// ─── What Noor has agreed to ────────────────────────────────────────────────

/// Net pay, twice a month. Each paycheck is divided at the source: 197.50 USD goes to the envelopes.
contract job with acme-corp
  2_450 USD twice monthly on 15, last into checking
  savings   50.00 USD for car                     // ▸ tied: not available to spend
  savings   30.00 USD for gifts
  savings   75.00 USD for travel
  savings   22.50 USD for subs
  savings   20.00 USD for medical

// ── The flat: three people, one lease ───────────────────────────────────────
// Noor is on the lease and pays all of it. The share of each roommate is an item that pays on their behalf:
// they owe it (§2 `for PARTY`, §7).

contract rent with pine-property
  3_150 USD monthly on 1 from checking #rent
  1_050.00 USD for ben                            // ▸ ben owes 1,050.00
  1_050.00 USD for cleo

contract electric with xcel
  about 96 USD monthly on 12 from checking #utilities
  33.33% for ben
  33.33% for cleo                                 // ▸ 33.34% stays hers

contract gas with xcel
  about 58 USD monthly on 14 from checking #utilities
  33.33% for ben
  33.33% for cleo

/// Comcast: a promotional price, then the list price. The promotion is a change that holds for a while.
contract internet with xfinity
  85 USD monthly on 9 from checking #utilities
  33.33% for ben
  33.33% for cleo
2026-01-01 internet 60 USD monthly until 2026-03-31 ^promo "12-month promotion"   // ▸ what she signed in April 2025
// ✎ 05b3: the declaration says 85 and holds from the book's first day; the promotion overrides it from the
// same day. The contract reads as if 85 were the rule and 60 the exception, when 60 is what she pays.

// ── Everything else, monthly ────────────────────────────────────────────────

contract phone with mint
  30 USD monthly on 3 from card #phone
contract netflix with netflix
  15.49 USD monthly on 22 from card
contract gym with peak-gym
  45 USD monthly on 1 from card

// ── Prepaid a year at a time ────────────────────────────────────────────────

/// Recognized 8.33 a month for a year from the day it is paid.
contract nyt with nyt
  100 USD yearly on 02-10 from card #subscriptions
  covers 1y
contract spotify with spotify
  129 USD yearly on 03-14 from card #subscriptions
  covers 1y
contract 1password with 1password
  35.88 USD yearly on 05-05 from card #subscriptions
  covers 1y

/// Six months at a time.
contract auto with geico
  612 USD every 6m on 04-01 from checking #insurance
  covers 6m

// ── Buy now, pay later ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/// Klarna: boots for 240 USD, 60 down and three payments of 60 every two weeks. A loan at nothing.
/// The 240 is spent on the day of the purchase, whatever the payment plan.
contract boots with klarna
  loan 180 USD on 2026-03-06 at 0% over 6w
  every 2w on friday from checking
  from 2026-03-20
